---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
    <div class="glass-panel" style="padding: 2rem;">
      <h1 class="h2 text-gradient" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Last Updated: July 28, 2026</p>

      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Welcome to DDU MATERIAL. By accessing or using our platform at <strong>ddumaterial.pages.dev</strong>, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully before using the platform.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">1. About DDU MATERIAL</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        DDU MATERIAL is a free, community-driven educational platform designed to help students of Dharmsinh Desai University (DDU) access and organize study materials such as notes, previous year question papers, lab manuals, and other academic resources. The platform is maintained by students, for students.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">2. User Accounts</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        To access study materials on DDU MATERIAL, you must sign in using your Google account. By signing in, you agree that:
      </p>
      <ul style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
        <li>The information provided through your Google account is accurate.</li>
        <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account session.</li>
        <li>You will not share your authenticated session with others or attempt to access other users' accounts.</li>
        <li>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        When using DDU MATERIAL, you agree to:
      </p>
      <ul style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem;">
        <li>Use the platform solely for educational and personal study purposes.</li>
        <li>Not upload, post, or share any content that is obscene, offensive, defamatory, or violates any law.</li>
        <li>Not attempt to disrupt, overload, or interfere with the platform's servers or infrastructure.</li>
        <li>Not use automated scripts, bots, or scrapers to mass-download content from the platform.</li>
        <li>Respect other users in comments and discussions.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">4. Content & Copyright</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        DDU MATERIAL hosts study materials contributed by students and educators within the DDU community. All materials are shared with the intention of supporting academic learning. If you believe any content on this platform infringes upon your copyright or intellectual property rights, please contact us immediately through our <a href="/feedback" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">Feedback page</a>, and we will promptly review and remove the content if necessary.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">5. User-Generated Content</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Users may post comments on files and submit feedback through the platform. By posting content, you grant DDU MATERIAL a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to display and store that content on the platform. You are solely responsible for the content of your comments. We reserve the right to remove any comments that violate these terms or are deemed inappropriate.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">6. Contributions</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Students may contribute study materials to the platform through our contribution form. By submitting materials, you confirm that you have the right to share them and that they do not infringe upon any third party's intellectual property rights. Contributed materials may be reviewed, organized, and made available to all users of the platform.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        DDU MATERIAL is provided on an "as-is" and "as-available" basis. We make no warranties or representations about the accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any study materials available on the platform. The materials are shared by community members and may contain errors. Always verify information with your official university syllabus, textbooks, and professors.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, DDU MATERIAL and its maintainers shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform, including but not limited to reliance on study materials, loss of data, or inability to access the platform.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">9. Modifications to These Terms</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be reflected on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. Your continued use of the platform after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.
      </p>

      <h2 class="h3" style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please reach out through our <a href="/feedback" style="color: var(--accent-primary);">Feedback page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
